{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act15side_level_act15side_01_end",
  "groupId": "act15side",
  "stageId": "act15side_01",
  "title": "化物",
  "storyCode": "IW-1",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "eddd8573ea5e992e7fe58b20731b33dbb253869a95ca2381d0027b0b4a031eed",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "1下"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嘁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？怎麼停下了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "莫不是剛才我出手太重，不小心傷了姑娘？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......哼，會點花裡胡哨的功夫，得意什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然已經被那江洋大盜跑了，再和你糾纏也沒有什麼意義，你這種——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——你叫什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "烏有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵，哪有賊人會自報姓名的，想必是什麼江湖名號吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸，您真聰明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我要是接著追，你是不是就不打算讓開了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不然怎麼說您聰明呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......還敢嘴硬！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還愣著幹什麼！一起上啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小姐！我們來幫忙了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——慢著！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咿......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡怎麼說也是客棧，二位再這麼鬧下去，瘡痍滿目，白給路人看笑話，怕是不太妥當。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嘁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過，二位打得精彩，給我們這些人開了眼界，賠償呢......我就不要了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但現在還請給我一個薄面，今天就先算了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉了，掌櫃的。事後解開誤會，我們自會登門道歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......看在掌櫃的面子上，這次就放過你吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不知道你們和他是什麼關係，勸你們好自為之，乖乖把他交出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要是包庇他，你們就都是同罪。放過你一時無妨，但尚蜀容不下你們這樣的法外之徒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真要是法外之徒，報警就是了，杜小姐何必私下動武呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "烏有兄弟說的是，再怎麼佔理，也不該一言不合就動起手來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這位小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "讓你的人退下吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小、小姐，就這麼放走他......？抓著他一個，等著那個龍門人上鉤——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......別嚷嚷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "反正那個龍門人已經跑了，留住這一個也沒多大用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......再說了，當真能留得住嗎？你是不是還有什麼手段沒使？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒有的事，和氣生財，和氣生財。既然這位小姐願意退一步，那是再好不過......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "烏有，我記住你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "貴人多忘事，但願您別記著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（悄悄地，悄悄地......好，這個距離差不多能衝出去了......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是賣鄭老頭一個面子，出了這道門檻，看誰還能保得住你。不如趁現在老老實實聽本小姐的話——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——喂！人呢！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他、他怎麼就這麼跑沒影了！？你們在做什麼！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......呃......是小姐您剛才也沒說到底要不要放走他......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......愣著幹什麼！追啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是、是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_npc_140_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......杜大小姐哎，您鬧得是不是太大了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你讓開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_npc_140_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸，欸，別——得了，家務事我可管不了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鄭老頭！你剛才為什麼無動於衷，反而還要攔著我！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......胡鬧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼胡鬧！你不是明知道他們會往應峰路走，才在這裡等著他們的嗎！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "城裡幾十家客棧酒樓都是我們的眼線，要抓一個不知輕重的小賊不是輕而易舉——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......不知輕重的是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不知道那隻酒盞是什麼物件，你更不知道剛才那龍門人，到底是什麼來頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "何況剛才有高人在場。如果他們真鐵了心把事情鬧大，贏的會是他們，佔理的也會是他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_296_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是什麼？你知道這一紙委託，到底幾斤幾兩？那位佚名主顧，又是怎樣一位人物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "憑你也想丟鏢局的臉嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......好像沒人追來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對不起各位，本來該是我領路的，卻落得如此田地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可我也實在是沒想到，到了尚蜀城內，竟然還能遇上這種事情......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "留那小夥子一個人，真沒問題嗎？我們這算不算坑了他？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那個老闆和那位盛氣凌人的小姐怕是認識。留下殿後的那位好漢，恐怕沒那麼容易脫身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼......鯉先生怎麼知道的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那姑娘分明幾次都在留意掌櫃的一舉一動，我不會看走眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看走眼，生意就沒法做了嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只能相信小烏有的逃跑速度了，這點我倒是對他有信心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......真沒事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒事。那個女孩也不敢在光天化日之下做什麼出格舉動吧？雖然人少，可那時裡裡外外，還是有一些路人的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......呼，能在這裡遇見你們羅德島，真是巧合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鯉先生怎麼會來尚蜀？是事務所的委託？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算是吧，不過只是一個老朋友委託給我的私事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......是那個盒子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可這真是奇了怪了，在這尚蜀城內，竟然還有人敢搶梁大人的東西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不奇怪。如果能安安穩穩抵達尚蜀，梁大人又何苦特地找我呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "梁大人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是我一位老同學......你就當是尚蜀的魏彥吾就行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔啊......魏先生啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......聽這口氣，各位與龍門魏公是熟識？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "平頭百姓也就罷了，可想在龍門混口飯吃的人，有幾個不熟知魏公？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "認識魏公，和魏公認識，是兩碼事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "確是如此，不過我和魏彥吾的那點孽緣，就先不提了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉。可惜，我是結識不了魏公那般人物了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......了不起是了不起，但也沒有那麼了不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這麼說，那位梁大人豈不是個大人物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "能算大人物嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算，怎麼不算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "慢著，你這話的意思是龍門魏公不算，還是梁大人不算？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就算吧，如今都是個大人物了，嘖嘖嘖。當年還只是個不懂變通的愣頭青呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......鯉先生倒還是老樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵，我在龍門討日子，和他一個尚蜀大官有多大關係？很久沒聯繫啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "快瞧，是那小夥子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小烏有！你沒事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎喲喲喲，別動，別動，渾身疼，渾身疼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "恩人哪，你是有所不知啊，剛才那丫頭耍起瘋勁來那叫一個狠，我使了渾身解數才勉強招架，趁著掌櫃拉架的空檔，趕緊開溜啦——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......看你跑過來的模樣，分明就沒受傷嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "扇子都收在手裡，哪使出渾身解數了嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃......瞞不過恩人......不過太久沒大張旗鼓地動過手了，確實有些抽筋......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......這位小兄弟是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "幹員烏有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然還沒正式入職，不過我那一顆鞠躬盡瘁的心，已經在羅德島跳動久矣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原來是新入職的幹員朋友，幸會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您好您好，聽恩人說，您也是羅德島的合作方？哎，不愧是羅德島，廣結善緣，深得人心，能結交到您這樣的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "叫我老鯉就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鯉兄客氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那麼，兄弟你剛才說，那位掌櫃拉架，你才有機會跑出來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "正是，怎麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嗯......看來事情也沒那麼簡單。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別站在這聊天了，人多眼雜，要是再出什麼岔子，我可擔待不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我們直接去梁府吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這些朋友......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "梁大人只交代了讓我接你，帶這麼多人過去是不是有點......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "想來梁大人也不是那麼小家子氣的人，各位剛才也幫了咱們一把，就一起去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "梁府啊......其實我們也不該去打攪別人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒關係，有我在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鯉兄這話爽快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_294_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好......既然決定了，那就快點走，這邊，來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鯉兄？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？啊......我馬上就來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嗷？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這是什麼......尚蜀難道流行這樣古怪的寵物嗎......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗷！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鯉兄！快跟上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......來了，這就來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_306_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嗷......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
